{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"certifiable":true,"criteria":[{"citation":{"kind":"file","line_end":595,"line_start":564,"path":"infra/scripts/autodeploy.sh"},"criterion":"After a blue-green container is reaped, the `compose-mcp:<sha>` image it was running is removed, while the live backend's image and the bare `$MCP_IMAGE` build tag are retained (checked by a test that reaps a fake container and asserts exactly which image references survive).","kind":"codebase-verifiable","met":true},{"citation":{"kind":"file","line_end":1730,"line_start":1694,"path":"tests/scripts/test_autodeploy_mcp_bluegreen.py"},"criterion":"A serving container's image is NEVER removed — the retire path removes an image only after the `docker rm` for that container has succeeded (checked by a test that seeds a RUNNING container and asserts no image removal is issued for it).","kind":"codebase-verifiable","met":true},{"citation":{"kind":"file","line_end":305,"line_start":293,"path":"infra/scripts/autodeploy.sh"},"criterion":"`prune_docker_caches` logs root-disk free space BEFORE and AFTER, and the delta, on every invocation (checked by asserting both values and the delta appear in the emitted log line).","kind":"codebase-verifiable","met":true},{"citation":{"kind":"file","line_end":385,"line_start":329,"path":"infra/scripts/autodeploy.sh"},"criterion":"When a reclaim completes and the disk is STILL at or above `DISK_PRESSURE_PCT`, the persisted streak counter increments; a below-threshold tick resets it to zero even though it takes the early return; a throttled pressured tick leaves it unchanged (checked by driving the counter across a pressure / throttle / relief sequence).","kind":"codebase-verifiable","met":true},{"citation":{"kind":"file","line_end":353,"line_start":351,"path":"infra/scripts/observability.sh"},"criterion":"At `PRESSURE_STREAK_ALARM` (default 3) or more consecutive ineffective cycles, a distinct marker is emitted (not the existing `AUTODEPLOY_DISK_PRESSURE`, which counts invocations) and `observability.sh` publishes it as its own delta metric, so it is alarmable without host access.","kind":"codebase-verifiable","met":true},{"citation":{"kind":"file","line_end":451,"line_start":428,"path":"tests/scripts/test_autodeploy_disk_pressure.py"},"criterion":"The new marker fires only on PERSISTENCE: a single pressured cycle that then recovers does NOT emit it (checked by a negative-control test — this is the discriminator, since an alarm that fires on any pressure is the flapping alarm we already have).","kind":"codebase-verifiable","met":true},{"citation":{"kind":"file","line_end":450,"line_start":279,"path":"infra/scripts/autodeploy.sh"},"criterion":"Bug 'Disk-pressure reclaim frees nothing: tagged blue-green images are never retired, and the reclaim reports success without measuring effect' is actually resolved: the reported defect no longer reproduces.","kind":"codebase-verifiable","met":true}],"findings":[],"material_fingerprint":null,"metrics":{"alias_index_build_ms":3610,"commits_inspected":2856,"descendant_ids":0,"descendant_scope_ms":9901,"det_ms":14920.9,"diff_validation_ms":399,"distinct_references":2389,"git_history_read_ms":272,"landing_check_ms":4360,"llm_calls":1,"llm_ms":118254.6,"material_policy_ms":0,"pre_verifier_total_ms":27425,"referencing_commits_found":1,"requests":15,"structural_scan_ms":12740,"ticket_ref_resolution_ms":68,"tool_calls":17,"total_ms":133258.7,"verifier_annotation_ms":0,"verifier_attempt_count":1,"verifier_attempt_setup_ms":5,"verifier_attempts_ms":581522,"verifier_between_attempts_ms":0,"verifier_build_drift_ms":689,"verifier_call_ms":581560,"verifier_code_snapshot_ms":8433,"verifier_completion_agent_ms":118254,"verifier_dispatch_finalization_ms":0,"verifier_d